WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.692
Your messages. Your photos. Not theirs.

2
00:00:03.692 --> 00:00:05.538
Big apps: Ads.

3
00:00:05.538 --> 00:00:07.385
An algorithm picks what you see.

4
00:00:07.385 --> 00:00:09.231
A company reads what you write.

5
00:00:09.231 --> 00:00:11.077
Enough.

6
00:00:11.077 --> 00:00:12.923
Zen. A private social network

7
00:00:12.923 --> 00:00:14.769
for people who know each other.

8
00:00:14.769 --> 00:00:16.615
No ads. No algorithms. Nobody decides for you what you see.

9
00:00:16.615 --> 00:00:18.462
No company reads your messages. Straight between your friends' phones.

10
00:00:18.462 --> 00:00:20.308
Post-quantum encryption. ML-KEM-768 + X25519 · Ed25519 + ML-DSA-65

11
00:00:20.308 --> 00:00:22.154
No sign-up. No phone number. Your QR code is your address.

12
00:00:22.154 --> 00:00:24.000
Your data stays with you. Encrypted with your password.

13
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:25.846
Free. Open source. Android · iPhone · Windows · Mac · Linux

14
00:00:25.846 --> 00:00:27.692
Your circle. Feed · Groups · Chats

15
00:00:27.692 --> 00:00:29.538
Posts only for the people you choose. You decide who sees what.

16
00:00:29.538 --> 00:00:31.385
The friend graph. Who knows whom, with a timeline.

17
00:00:31.385 --> 00:00:33.231
Meet people through people. Introductions through friends you trust.

18
00:00:33.231 --> 00:00:35.077
Audio and video calls. Screen sharing included.

19
00:00:35.077 --> 00:00:42.462
Zen — a private social network for people who know each other. No servers of its own. No ads. No algorithms. Download: robertostrowskijagoda.github.io/Zen
[Music: “Specular City” by vitalezzz (CC0)]
